| > s       say to the Marshal                                         ||
|   a       open the architecture                                      ||
|   r       restart a task                                             ||
|   m       change model or provider                                   ||
|   p       pause everything                                           ||
|   Ctrl+X  stop all workers                                           ||
|   l       limits and workers                                         ||
